00:16:22,280 --> 00:16:24,340
つかまえて、ほら
"Catch it, look,"

3
00:16:24,530 --> 00:16:26,770
この shooting star
this shooting star,

4
00:16:26,990 --> 00:16:32,640
a world of our fiction awaits

5
00:16:47,412 --> 00:16:52,372
ずっと同じ毎日に迷いがあっても
Even if I'm lost in the same daily routine,

6
00:16:52,712 --> 00:16:56,522
気づかないふりをしてたんだ
I acted like I didn't notice.

7
00:16:57,222 --> 00:17:02,132
ほんのちょっとの勇気がまだ出せなくって
Still unable to muster even a little bit of true courage,

8
00:17:02,422 --> 00:17:07,442
まどろむ宇宙でさまよっていた
I wandered in a slumbering universe.

9
00:17:08,092 --> 00:17:11,422
夜空に浮かぶ
Floating in the night sky,

10
00:17:11,422 --> 00:17:14,382
星に願いをかけるんだ
I make a wish upon a star.

11
00:17:17,412 --> 00:17:21,602
i hope… 抱いている夢を
I hope... the dream I hold onto

12
00:17:21,602 --> 00:17:24,522
絶対諦めたくない
I absolutely don't want to give up.

13
00:17:24,712 --> 00:17:27,452
走り出すから
Because I'm going to start running,

14
00:17:28,452 --> 00:17:30,252
追いかけて 今
Chase after it now,

15
00:17:30,362 --> 00:17:32,352
あの shooting star
that shooting star.

16
00:17:32,582 --> 00:17:37,522
見たことのないストーリー
A story I've never seen before,

17
00:17:37,692 --> 00:17:40,022
進んでいくんだ
I'm going to advance into it.

18
00:17:40,092 --> 00:17:44,232
いつの日にかきっと
Someday for sure,

19
00:17:44,412 --> 00:17:47,402
描いた世界へ
To the world I envisioned,

20
00:17:47,482 --> 00:17:51,682
辿り着けるように
So that I can reach it.

21
00:17:58,771 --> 00:18:00,681
let go

22
00:18:00,681 --> 00:18:04,251
of the days you thought mattered so

23
00:18:04,251 --> 00:18:04,724
life goes on, tomorrow's rolling in

24
00:18:04,724 --> 00:18:07,824
is it the world we know, or the dream we sought so long?

25
00:18:08,785 --> 00:18:13,455
もっと誰でもない自分になりたいんだ
I want to become someone who is truly myself,

26
00:18:13,705 --> 00:18:18,145
新しい風が心を揺らした
A new wind shook my heart.

27
00:18:19,485 --> 00:18:22,405
it takes something to believe

28
00:18:22,405 --> 00:18:27,795
the wish we were promised could really come to life

29
00:18:28,015 --> 00:18:31,975
and so, if this is how the story goes

30
00:18:31,975 --> 00:18:37,515
to find that strength inside, I'll remember why back then

31
00:18:37,515 --> 00:18:39,405
you took my hand, and you said

32
00:18:40,006 --> 00:18:42,526
つかまえて、ほら
"Catch it, look,"

33
00:18:42,686 --> 00:18:44,776
この shooting star
this shooting star.

34
00:18:44,996 --> 00:18:49,796
さあ、まずは一歩踏み出して恐れずにゆこう
Come on, first take a step forward and go without fear.

35
00:18:51,266 --> 00:18:55,246
いつの日にかきっと
Someday for sure,

36
00:18:55,456 --> 00:19:00,126
まだ見ぬ世界へ辿り着けるように
So that I can reach a world I've yet to see.

37
00:19:09,938 --> 00:19:13,358
夜明けに咲いた月が
The moon that bloomed at dawn

38
00:19:13,358 --> 00:19:16,298
眩いブルーの空に溶けてく
Melts into the dazzling blue sky.

39
00:19:19,818 --> 00:19:22,068
you and i, an undecided future

40
00:19:22,068 --> 00:19:24,498
doesn't matter if the final truth hurts

41
00:19:24,988 --> 00:19:28,498
もうすぐ朝が動き出すから
Morning is about to start moving soon,

42
00:19:29,858 --> 00:19:32,508
抱きしめて 今 この shooting star
So hold tight now to this shooting star.

43
00:19:33,428 --> 00:19:39,418
見たことのないストーリー
A story I've never seen before,

44
00:19:39,758 --> 00:19:43,638
I'll be here betting on that fearsome heart

45
00:19:43,938 --> 00:19:46,488
'cause you're that shooting star

46
00:19:46,878 --> 00:19:49,098
It's hopeless now, but maybe

47
00:19:49,098 --> 00:19:52,318
if you take that step into the darkness

48
00:19:52,318 --> 00:19:56,118
you'll find me running by your side until the dawn

49
00:19:56,658 --> 00:19:59,838
